Package: bande-avd-gstreamer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Mikael Hug <mikaelhug@gmail.com>
Section: video
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Recommends: bande-avd-firmware
Description: GStreamer plugins for hardware video decoding on the Mac mini M2
 The v4l2codecs and videoparsersbad plugins of GStreamer's bad set, which
 decode H.264, HEVC and VP9 on the M2's video decoder, without the rest of
 the set and what it pulls in.
